{"abstract":[{"text":"Wraps a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService"},{"text":" so a transient failure to read entitlements never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presents a previously-seen paid user as free.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/currentSnapshot()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfo()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/restorePurchases()"],"generated":true}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","isActive":true},{"text":" populates ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallState","isActive":true},{"text":" — and therefore the feature gate,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"account display, and whether the paywall sheet is shown — entirely from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"snapshots its wrapped service emits. A slow, silent, or throwing entitlement","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read at cold launch leaves that state at its ","type":"text"},{"code":"free","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" default. This decorator","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps a persisted last-known-good so the gate never collapses to free on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transient failure, while the server remains the authoritative gate: a later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"live snapshot always overwrites the cache, so a genuine lapse is honoured.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The cache is bounded by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxCacheAge"},{"text":" (72 hours by default): a stale cache","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stops vouching for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro"},{"text":" — subscriptions lapse, and an install that stays","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offline past the bound must not keep pro forever — but keeps","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"text":", because lifetime purchases don’t expire.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Provider-agnostic by construction — it speaks only ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService"},{"text":", so it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wraps any base (simulated, RevenueCat, StoreKit, …). Feed the wrapped instance","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"both","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin"},{"text":" and any app-side reader that builds a","typ